/// The number of leading entries of [`ICON_FALLBACK`] that carry geometry.
///
/// The curated tokens are declared first, so the entries with polygons are a prefix, and a
/// build without `data` can draw exactly these tokens. `icon.rs`'s fallback test asserts the
/// table matches this number, so a table that grew geometry for a catalogue token fails the
/// test instead of quietly adding a few kilobytes per icon to every build.
pub const FALLBACK_GEOMETRY_ENTRIES: usize = 75;
